  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "\\(f(-2)=1\\) and \\(f(2)=5\\) and \\(f\\) is continuous also.\r\nSo intermediate value theorem, function \\(f(x)\\) takes all values between 1 to 5 .\r\n\\(\\Rightarrow \\quad 2 \\frac{1}{3}\\) and \\(3 \\frac{1}{4}\\) lies in 1 to 5 so option \\(B, C\\) are correct",
